 6.  **Rasterization:** For each pixel $u$ covered by the primitive's bounding box, compute the 2D Skew-Normal density $SN^{2D}(u) = G_2(u - \mu^{2D}; \Omega^{2D}) \Phi \left( (m^{2D})^\top (u - \mu^{2D}) \right)$, where $G_2$ is the 2D Gaussian PDF and $\Phi$ is the standard normal CDF [S1, unofficial]. Compute spatial influence $a_i(u) = o_i SN^{2D}(u)$ [S1, unofficial].
 7.  **Color Aggregation:** Sort primitives by depth [G]. Aggregate color using front-to-back alpha blending with signed opacity: $C(u) = \sum_{i \in \mathcal{N}} c_i o_i SN_i^{2D}(u) \prod_{j=1}^{i-1} (1 - o_j SN_j^{2D}(u))$ [S1, unofficial].
+8.  **Joint Optimization:** Phase 1 jointly optimizes all parameters ($R, S, m_k, d_k$) using the standard Adam optimizer to establish a reasonable global structure [S1, unofficial].
+9.  **Block Coordinate Descent:** Phase 2 uses a cyclic alternating schedule: Part 1 updates ellipsoidal base parameters ($R, S$) while freezing skew parameters ($m_k, d_k$); Part 2 refines skew parameters ($m_k, d_k$) while holding ($R, S$) constant [S1, unofficial].
+10. **Positional Update:** Update positional parameters $\mu$ using Stochastic Gradient Hamiltonian Monte Carlo (SGHMC) to escape local minima [S1, unofficial].
 
